# Copiar a /etc/pi-backup.env (chmod 600) para subir cada respaldo, cifrado, a un repo privado de GitHub.
# Copy to /etc/pi-backup.env (chmod 600) to push each backup, encrypted, to a private GitHub repo.
# 1) Repo privado solo para respaldos / A private repo used only for backups.
# 2) Clave age: generarla en OTRO equipo (age-keygen -o clave.txt) y poner aquí solo la pública
#    en /etc/pi-backup.age.pub. La privada NO debe estar en el Pi.
#    age key: generate it on ANOTHER machine (age-keygen -o key.txt) and put only the public one
#    in /etc/pi-backup.age.pub. The private key must NOT be on the Pi.
# 3) Llave de despliegue con escritura solo a ese repo / Deploy key with write access to that repo only:
#    ssh-keygen -t ed25519 -N "" -f /root/.ssh/backup_deploy
#    gh repo deploy-key add /root/.ssh/backup_deploy.pub --repo USER/REPO --allow-write
BACKUP_REPO=git@github.com:USUARIO/REPO-DE-RESPALDOS.git
BACKUP_KEY=/root/.ssh/backup_deploy
BACKUP_KEEP_REMOTE=14
